BEHAVIOR accept

DESCRIPTION
  Server-side: waits for and accepts a client connection.
  Call after listen. Blocks until client connects.
  Returns new client_fd for this connection.
  Use client_fd with send/receive, then close-socket.

CONTRACT
  INPUT fd int 8
  OUTPUT client_fd int 8
  OUTPUT client_addr bytes 128
  OUTPUT addr_len int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH e88849be

NATIVE
